description.narrative:
Following the support to the Civil Society UPR Monitoring Working Group, the following results have been achieved.

- Comprehensive and informative parallel report was prepared by the CSO groups for Ethiopias 3rd UPR session;

- Trainings and workshops held improving awareness of other stakeholders on the implementation of the UPR recommendations in general and critical human rights issues in particular;

- Enhanced participation of members of the CSO taskforce to the UPR;

- Improved collaboration among the members of human rights CSOs in Ethiopia
